    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`-` treats a URI buffer name (`term://`, `man://`) as a path and\r\nnavigates to a bogus directory.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nDetect URI names like `filetype.lua` does, and open the cwd as for unnamed buffers (goes beyond the scope of just `:terminal`.\r\n\r\n\r\nCloses #41030 ",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-28T17:37:07Z",
